# Firebase service account keys (used only by scripts/seed-dummy-data.mjs)
# — grants full admin access to the Firebase project, must never be
# committed. Matches Firebase Console's default download filename pattern,
# plus a couple of likely renames as a safety net.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json

